From: TB710FU clean board
Subject: [PATCH] Keep the marked TTBR1 helper callable for diagnostics

The stage reporter must wrap the actual branch selected by
TB710FU_SWITCH_MARKS=1. Keep the literal marker helper out of line so its
call site and target survive native compilation as an auditable direct call.
This changes no boot behavior when the diagnostic reporter is absent.
diff --git a/osfmk/arm64/arm_vm_init.c b/osfmk/arm64/arm_vm_init.c
--- a/osfmk/arm64/arm_vm_init.c
+++ b/osfmk/arm64/arm_vm_init.c
@@ -98,2 +98,2 @@
-static void
+__attribute__((noinline)) static void
 set_mmu_ttb_alternate_probed(uint64_t ttbr1)
